OL,3,GNEWSAWoman seriously hurt in crash
OL,4,Ainvolving lorry and car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has suffered serious injuries
OL,7,Fin a crash involving a lorry and car in
OL,8,FWest Sussex, police said.
OL,10,FThe crash happened on Lewes Road (A22),
OL,11,FEast Grinstead, just before 05:30 BST.
OL,13,FA Sussex Police spokesperson said the
OL,14,Fdriver of the car has been taken to
OL,15,Fhospital.
OL,17,FThe road has been closed between
OL,18,FWorsted Lane and Luxfords Lane, they
OL,19,Fadded.
